WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
A football coach shouts
one word at a player:

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.690
«Écoute !» It means Listen!

3
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.170
Short, sharp, bossy.

4
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.990
Now look closely at the spelling.

5
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.920
Somewhere along the way, this
order has lost its final letter.

6
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.880
Which letter, and why?

7
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.500
And what if the coach wants
the whole team to listen?

8
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.350
Or wants to say Let's go,

9
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.210
or Don't forget?

10
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.730
So how do you boss
someone around in French,

11
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.730
and why does Listen lose its final letter?

12
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:30.400
In this mission, you'll
give orders to one friend

13
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.980
and to a whole group,

14
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.390
and learn to say Be calm.

15
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:37.530
Then you'll build orders
from word chips in the lab.

16
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.560
Your mission: crack the code for
bossing people around in French.
